  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Pakistan 2024 &#x2013; Revision white paper</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2022, Pakistan was severely hit by a major climate-related disaster; a monstruous monsoon. This resulted into thousands of casualties, as well as recovery, reconstruction and resilience needs of billions of US dollars.At the request of the government of Pakistan, the Netherlands has developed a roadmap and white paper for improving governance for flood resilience in Pakistan by applying an stabilisation mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
